on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <0>
  [  3] extcall 1 ............................... puppetSound(0)
  [  5] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  7] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  9] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [ 11] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = the volume of sound 2
  [ 13] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 15] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 16] gt ...................................... <volym > 0>
  [ 17] jmpifz [ 47] ............................ repeat while volym > 0
  [ 20] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 22] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 24] sub ..................................... <volym - 10>
  [ 25] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = volym - 10
  [ 27] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 29] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 31] pusharglist 1 ........................... <volym>
  [ 33] extcall 73 .............................. <integer(volym)>
  [ 35] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 37] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to integer(volym)
  [ 39] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 41] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <6>
  [ 43] extcall 53 .............................. Wait(6)
  [ 45] endrepeat [ 13]
  [ 47] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 48] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <0>
  [ 50] extcall 1 ............................... puppetSound(0)
  [ 52] pushsymb 79 ............................. <#stop>
  [ 54] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 56] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [ 58] extcall 80 .............................. sound stop 2
