  [ 62] extcall 78 .............................. unloadMember()
  [ 64] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 66] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <4>
  [ 68] extcall 66 .............................. cursor(4)
  [ 70] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 72] pushcons 0 .............................. <"kalender">
